BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:History
DESCRIPTION:Remember when the path to good hygiene was anything but clean?
  From splinter-filled toilet paper and barbers who doubled as surgeons\, 
 to communal drinking cups shared by everyone in town and ear candles burn
 ing too close for comfort\, yesterday's sanitation solutions often blurre
 d the line between health and hazard. These are the everyday habits\, gro
 oming rituals and routine remedies that promised to keep us fresh… but of
 ten went afoul.
DTEND:20260831T014200Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T011103Z
DTSTART:20260831T010000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:TENTATIVE
SUMMARY:Hazardous History with Henry Winkler - 2x19 - Horrible Hygiene
UID:NzbDrone_episode_43296
END:VEVENT
